          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most large basements, shops and small warehouses, the AlorAir Storm Pro is the commercial dehumidifier to buy: a real 85 AHAM pints, a pump that lifts water nearly 15 feet and a modest amp draw. Step up to the Storm Elite for a big open space with a circuit to spare, choose the Abestorm Hurricane 800 to save money, and pick the Santa Fe Impact155 when one machine has to serve several rooms through ducts.
          </p>
